Add to the end of `/etc/nginx/sites-available/default`:
```text
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name www.example.com;
    return 301 $scheme://example.com$request_uri;
}

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name example.com;

    # Your existing configuration for example.com
    location / {
        # Your configuration here
    }
}
```

